m01_stop_confirm_go=&Stop
m01_stopped=Stopped. Nobody can use Slate Operations, and backups do not run. Select Start Slate Operations.
m01_not_started=Not started. Slate Operations does not start automatically when this PC starts. Select Start Slate Operations.
